# Teaching Arms-Race Concepts in Intermediate Microeconomics.

**Authors:** Anderton, Charles H.

## Abstract
Develops a simple model of the arms race using fundamental microeconomic analysis. States that the exercise reinforces learning and demonstrates the practical usefulness of economic methodology to analyze the world. (DB)

